---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Audit booké ! | Lancio"
  description="Votre audit est réservé. Voici la suite."
  canonical="https://lancio.fr/audit-confirme/"
>

<nav class="nav-merci">
  <div class="container nav-merci-inner">
    <a href="/" class="nav-merci-logo">Lancio</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="merci">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="merci-card">

      <div class="merci-icon">
        <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
          <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="32" fill="var(--accent-pale)"/>
          <path d="M20 32l8 8 16-16" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h1>Audit booké !</h1>
      <p class="merci-sub">Tu vas recevoir un email de confirmation avec le lien et le créneau. À très vite.</p>

      <div class="merci-info">
        <div class="merci-info-icon">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="9" fill="var(--accent-pale)"/><path d="M9 5v4M9 12h.01" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="merci-info-title">Une question ?</div>
          <div class="merci-info-desc">Écris-moi à <a href="mailto:hello@lancio.fr">hello@lancio.fr</a> ou sur <a href="https://wa.me/33787686005" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="/" class="merci-back">← Retour à l'accueil</a>

    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<script is:inline>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  window.dataLayer.push({
    event: 'audit_booked',
    value: 50,
    currency: 'EUR'
  });
</script>

</Layout>

<style>
  .nav-merci { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 16px 0; }
  .nav-merci-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .nav-merci-logo { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 24px; color: var(--text-primary); }

  .merci {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 60px 0;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .merci-card {
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 48px 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .merci-icon { margin-bottom: 24px; }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .merci-sub {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .merci-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    text-align: left;
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .merci-info-icon { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
  .merci-info-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .merci-info-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; }
  .merci-info-desc a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }

  .merci-back {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .merci-back:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .merci-card { padding: 32px 24px; }
    h1 { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
